  "translation": {
    "english_title": "We can walk on water",
    "sections": [
      {
        "ordinal": 1,
        "source_label": "மதனன்",
        "english_label": "Madanan",
        "source_tamil_lines": [
          "நீர்மேல் நடக்கலாம்",
          "நெருப்பிலே படுக்கலாம்",
          "நிலை தடுமாறினால் நினைத்ததைப் பேசலாம்"
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "We can walk on water,",
          "We can lie down in fire,",
          "If our state staggers, we can say whatever we think."
        ],
        "notes": [
          "The deliberately impossible water/fire claims remain literal; `நிலை தடுமாறினால்` keeps the staggering-state/intoxication force."
        ]
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 2,
        "source_label": "மதனன்",
        "english_label": "Madanan",
        "source_tamil_lines": [
          "உலகம் சுத்துது எதனாலே? நம்",
          "உடம்பு சுத்துது அதனாலே",
          "உலகம் சுத்துது எதனாலே?"
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "Why does the world spin? Our,",
          "body spins — that's why,",
          "Why does the world spin?"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "The source line-break after `நம்` is retained rather than silently recast into a new lyric line."
        ]
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 3,
        "source_label": "வீரர்கள்",
        "english_label": "Warriors",
        "source_tamil_lines": ["நம்ம உடம்பு சுத்துது அதனாலே"],
        "english_lines": ["Our body spins — that's why."],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 4,
        "source_label": "மதனன்",
        "english_label": "Madanan",
        "source_tamil_lines": [
          "கலகம் வருவது எதனாலே?",
          "கலயம் பொங்குது அதனாலே",
          "கலகம் வருவது எதனாலே?",
          "கலயம் பொங்குது அதனாலே",
          "சொர்க்கம் தெரியுது எதனாலே?",
          "மயக்கம் வருது அதனாலே",
          "சொர்க்கம் தெரியுது எதனாலே"
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "Why does kalagam — commotion — come?",
          "Because the kalayam pot bubbles over,",
          "Why does kalagam — commotion — come?",
          "Because the kalayam pot bubbles over,",
          "Why does heaven appear?",
          "Because dizziness comes,",
          "Why does heaven appear?"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "`கலகம் / கலயம்` is a sound-driven joke. Both Tamil sounds are kept audible while `commotion` and `pot` supply the source meanings rather than inventing a different English pun.",
          "`மயக்கம்` remains dizziness/intoxication rather than being romanticized."
        ]
      },
      {
